Sheprd

This file lists the code in Sheprd that comes from other open-source
projects. Each entry names the project, its copyright holder, its licence,
where the code lives in Sheprd, and where the licence text is.

- T3 Code (https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code)
  Copyright (c) 2026 T3 Tools Inc. MIT License.
  In Sheprd, one folder for each copied package, all under third_party/t3code/:
    third_party/t3code/effect-acp (the Agent Client Protocol client and server)
    third_party/t3code/node-sqlite (the SQLite client for Node.js)
    third_party/t3code/provider-instance (provider instance settings and home layouts)
    third_party/t3code/provider-testing (replay and fake-program test helpers)
    third_party/t3code/source-control (the commit-message credit remover)
  Each file, its source file in T3 Code and its changes are listed in
  third_party/t3code/README.md.
  Licence text: third_party/t3code/LICENSE.

Sheprd is also inspired by Herdr Synapse
(https://github.com/vitalysim/herdr-synapse), Copyright 2026 Vitaly
Simonovich, Apache License 2.0. No Synapse code has been copied into Sheprd.
If any is, it will be listed here with its licence.
